Storage Redundancy:

Azure automatically replicates your data.

LRS (Locally Redundant Storage)
Datacenter

Copy1
Copy2
Copy3

Three copies in a single datacenter.

ZRS (Zone-Redundant Storage)
Zone1
Zone2
Zone3

Copies are distributed across availability zones.

GRS (Geo-Redundant Storage)
Central India
        │
        ▼
South India

Replicates to a paired region.

GZRS (Geo-Zone Redundant Storage)

Combines:

Zone redundancy
Geographic redundancy

Highest resilience.

Comparison
Type	Copies	Survives
LRS	3	Disk/server failure
ZRS	Across zones	Zone failure
GRS	Across regions	Regional outage
GZRS	Zones + regions	Zone and regional outages
