Storage Security

Best Practices:

Use Private Endpoints.
Disable public access if not required.
Use Microsoft Entra ID (Azure AD) authentication.
Store secrets in Azure Key Vault.
Enable soft delete.
Enable versioning.
Encrypt data at rest (enabled by default).
