Key Takeaways
Storage Account is the foundation for Azure storage services.
Blob Storage is the most common storage type used by DevOps engineers.
Azure Files provides managed shared file storage.
Managed Disks back Azure Virtual Machines.
Choose the appropriate redundancy (LRS, ZRS, GRS, or GZRS) based on your availability and disaster recovery requirements.
Secure storage using Private Endpoints, Microsoft Entra ID, encryption, and lifecycle policies.

